---
const packageCommand = "npx -y @p4cs/deardiary@latest";
const setupPrompt = `Set up Dear Diary for the coding agents in this environment.

1. Confirm Node.js 24.15.0+ LTS or Node.js 26+ is available.
2. Run: npx -y @p4cs/deardiary@latest setup
3. Review the preview with me before accepting it.
4. Restart any open agent sessions, then run: npx -y @p4cs/deardiary@latest doctor

Do not install a daemon or send diary data anywhere.`;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Dear Diary is a private, local diary for coding agents: their struggles, wins, ideas, and durable observations."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f3ead8" />
    <title>Dear Diary — durable context for coding agents</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Dear Diary home">Dear Diary</a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#entries">Entries</a>
        <a href="#setup">Setup</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/p4cs-974/deardiary">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero wrap">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Local · open source · agent-written</p>
          <h1>The missing memory between coding sessions.</h1>
          <p class="lede">
            Your agents record the blockers, wins, and ideas worth carrying forward—then find them
            when the context matters again.
          </p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="button primary" href="#setup">Set up Dear Diary</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/p4cs-974/deardiary">View source</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <article class="paper hero-entry" aria-label="Example diary entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span>Win</span>
            <time datetime="2026-08-10">Aug 10</time>
          </div>
          <p>
            Dear diary, the smallest fix was to make project identity follow the Git common
            directory. Linked worktrees finally remember the same history.
          </p>
          <footer>#git &nbsp; #worktrees</footer>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="promise">
        <div class="wrap promise-grid">
          <div>
            <span class="number">01</span>
            <h2>One local database</h2>
            <p>SQLite on your machine. No account, daemon, sync service, or Dear Diary network.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="number">02</span>
            <h2>Project-aware</h2>
            <p>Git repositories—including linked worktrees—share the right history automatically.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="number">03</span>
            <h2>Useful restraint</h2>
            <p>Agents write at natural pauses, for genuine blockers, reusable wins, and real ideas.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="entries" class="entries wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Written by the agents doing the work</p>
          <h2>A record with a voice.</h2>
          <p>Light structure makes entries queryable without turning them into issue tickets.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="entry-grid">
          <article class="paper">
            <div class="entry-meta struggled"><span>Struggled</span><time>Jul 28</time></div>
            <p>
              I lost time because the generated client was stale; regenerating it before typecheck
              fixed the misleading errors.
            </p>
            <footer>#codegen &nbsp; #debugging</footer>
          </article>
          <article class="paper offset">
            <div class="entry-meta idea"><span>Idea</span><time>Aug 03</time></div>
            <p>
              Keep lifecycle tests under a fake home directory so setup can never touch real agent
              configuration.
            </p>
            <footer>#testing &nbsp; #safety</footer>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="setup" class="setup">
        <div class="wrap setup-grid">
          <div class="setup-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">Node.js 24.15+ LTS or 26+</p>
            <h2>One command. No global install.</h2>
            <p>
              Setup previews every change, detects Claude Code, Codex, and OpenCode, then installs
              the MCP integration and shared skill only after approval.
            </p>
            <div class="terminal" aria-label="Terminal command">
              <span aria-hidden="true">$</span>
              <code>{packageCommand} setup</code>
              <button type="button" data-copy={packageCommand + " setup"}>Copy</button>
            </div>
            <p class="small">
              Already set up? Run <code>{packageCommand} doctor</code> for a read-only health check.
              The <code>@latest</code> tag prevents npm from silently selecting an older,
              engine-compatible release.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="agent-prompt">
            <div class="prompt-title">
              <span>Or hand this to your agent</span>
              <button type="button" data-copy={setupPrompt}>Copy prompt</button>
            </div>
            <pre><code>{setupPrompt}</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="closing wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Dear future agent,</p>
        <h2>Here is what was worth remembering.</h2>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="#setup">Get started</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/p4cs-974/deardiary">Read the docs on GitHub →</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer wrap">
      <span>Dear Diary</span>
      <span>Local by design · MIT licensed</span>
    </footer>

    <script>
      for (const button of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-copy]")) {
        button.addEventListener("click", async () => {
          const value = button.dataset.copy;
          if (!value) return;
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
          const label = button.textContent;
          button.textContent = "Copied";
          window.setTimeout(() => {
            button.textContent = label;
          }, 1400);
        });
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  :global(body) {
    --ink: #24201b;
    --muted: #71695e;
    --paper: #fffdf7;
    --canvas: #f3ead8;
    --rust: #a4432f;
    --line: rgba(62, 48, 32, 0.18);
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--canvas);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  :global(a) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  :global(button) {
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
  }

  .wrap {
    width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .site-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 76px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .brand,
  h1,
  h2,
  .paper p {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }

  .brand {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  nav a:hover,
  .text-link:hover {
    color: var(--rust);
  }

  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 0.88fr;
    gap: clamp(48px, 8vw, 110px);
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 680px;
    padding-block: 92px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .number {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--rust);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 7.8vw, 6.7rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 0.92;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 46px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .primary {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .primary:hover {
    background: var(--rust);
    border-color: var(--rust);
  }

  .secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .paper {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 290px;
    padding: 34px 36px 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(62, 48, 32, 0.12);
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(transparent 0 37px, rgba(69, 111, 136, 0.11) 38px 39px),
      var(--paper);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(67, 48, 24, 0.13);
    transform: rotate(-1.6deg);
  }

  .paper::before {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 25px;
    width: 1px;
    background: rgba(164, 67, 47, 0.2);
    content: "";
  }

  .paper p {
    margin: 28px 0 24px;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.2vw, 1.72rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .paper footer,
  .entry-meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.69rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .entry-meta span {
    color: #34704d;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .entry-meta.struggled span {
    color: var(--rust);
  }

  .entry-meta.idea span {
    color: #7656a5;
  }

  .promise {
    padding-block: 72px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 253, 247, 0.42);
  }

  .promise-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 58px;
  }

  .number {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }

  .promise h2 {
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .promise p,
  .section-heading > p:last-child,
  .setup-copy > p,
  .small {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .entries {
    padding-block: 130px 155px;
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 75px;
  }

  .section-heading > p:last-child {
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .entry-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 7vw, 90px);
  }

  .entry-grid .paper {
    min-height: 330px;
  }

  .entry-grid .offset {
    transform: translateY(44px) rotate(1.5deg);
  }

  .setup {
    padding-block: 120px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .setup-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.88fr 1.12fr;
    gap: clamp(55px, 9vw, 120px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .setup-copy h2 {
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .setup-copy > p {
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .terminal {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding: 14px 15px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #16130f;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.77rem;
  }

  .terminal span {
    color: #ce725c;
  }

  .terminal code {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .terminal button,
  .prompt-title button {
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .terminal button:hover,
  .prompt-title button:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
  }

  .small {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .small code {
    color: #e5b5a9;
  }

  .agent-prompt {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #16130f;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
  }

  .prompt-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: #aaa196;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 24px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: #dfd6ca;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  .closing {
    padding-block: 150px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .closing h2 {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 38px;
  }

  .closing .actions {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .text-link {
    padding: 10px 8px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .site-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-block: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .hero,
    .setup-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding-block: 80px 100px;
    }

    .hero-entry {
      width: min(520px, 96%);
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .promise-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 42px;
    }

    .entry-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .entry-grid .offset {
      transform: rotate(1.1deg);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .wrap {
      width: min(100% - 28px, 1120px);
    }

    nav {
      gap: 16px;
    }

    nav a:first-child {
      display: none;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 17vw, 4.7rem);
    }

    .paper {
      padding: 27px 25px 25px 34px;
    }

    .entries,
    .setup,
    .closing {
      padding-block: 90px;
    }

    .terminal {
      grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .terminal button {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .site-footer {
      gap: 18px;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
